  {
   "id": "virgo-versus-the-zodiac-28772@major-2023-08-23",
   "gameId": "virgo-versus-the-zodiac-28772",
   "displayName": "Content Update: Boss Rush mode and Bonus Zodiac Memories: Play as the Zodiacs!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-08-23T16:36:07.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello, Surviving Life Forms!!!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Today is the most awaited day of the year when Moonana releases that update promised on the Crowdfunding Campaign thousands of years ago, to prove not only this amazing team has excellent memory, but we are the keeper of promises, no matter how long it takes. This update contains the following:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Zodiac Memories",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Enter the memories of Aquarius, Scorpio, Libra and Gemini and enjoy a new window into the perspectives of these Zodiac. As Aquarius, board her airship and discover what happened while Virgo rode the Megalithic Train to Leo's Golden Colosseum. As Scorpio, set sail down the River Styx and traverse through the Unholy Cabaret. As Libra, enter the Astrological Court and oversee the 101st Eye Removal Tournament. As Gemini, return to the Dioskourai Library to clean up the virus infestation and discover the truth of the Indexers plot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Boss Rush",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In this special challenge mode, Virgo, Spica and Algol will take on the Zodiac in the sequence of their appearance in game. Before each fight you will be given a chance to upgrade and equip your characters with a set amount of resources at your disposal. Each victory will see your resources increase until you've successfully overcome all Zodiacal forces. Prepare your strategy, make your build and defeat the Zodiac in this special mode which is sure to test even the most veteran Virgo Versus The Zodiac player.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game is currently out everywhere as well, you guys can stop asking me while I withheld all this important information!!! So make sure to get it on all of your preferred platforms.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you very much for following the game for this many years and for your patience on waiting for this update and the game's launch to every single platform ever created.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I hope you have fun, I had loads of fun working on this update with the guys.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your forever Alpaca of the Moonana lands,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nana Moon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
