  {
   "id": "virgo-versus-the-zodiac-28772@1.1.2",
   "gameId": "virgo-versus-the-zodiac-28772",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1.2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-07-01T01:16:11.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A new free demo of Virgo Versus the Zodiac has been released, comprising the entirety of the Capricorn realm. The game executable has been updated as well for compatibility so that players who complete the demo and then purchase the full game will be able to pick up right where they left off.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Version 1.1.2 patch details",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Cleaned up some cutscenes in Capricorn realm.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added save transfer support for completed demo saves",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "and... the creator from Moonana has something that she wants to share with every Virgo fan!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hello, citizens of Earth!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I hope you are having a good day!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The world is in a very bad place right now, but I hope you're all safe and living a healthy life filled with cool games!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To bring some good news, recently we launched a Steam page for our newest game. It's called Keylocker | Turn-Based Cyberpunk Action!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The gameplay is similar to Virgo, so I hope you guys will enjoy our newest game, too!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you guys could wishlist, please do so! Wishlisting helps us a lot in bringing attention to the game when it's launched. The more wishlists there are, the more attention we can get within Steam's mysterious algorithms!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please do check our gameplay video as well on YouTube: it shows 15 mins of our very, very early alpha/complete beginning of the game/development!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I hope you all have a great day!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nana.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
